# config.search_profiles_dir() resolves here under the fresh-clone example config
# (config.example.yaml sets no paths.search_profiles_dir, so the accessor derives
# <overlay_root>/market/searches = examples/market/searches). The directory has to
# EXIST for a bare `--profile <label>` to resolve, and git does not track empty
# directories — hence this file.
#
# Only this file is meant to be tracked: `examples/market/searches/*.yaml` is
# git-ignored, the same way `examples/market/scans/current/*.md` is, so a real
# search profile parked here cannot reach a commit. Real profiles belong in the
# private overlay (private/market/searches/) — see ../../../skills/job-search/profiles/README.md.
